          "content": "# trivectorlabs.ai - Crypto Execution\\n\\nReceives a risk-approved trade proposal from the Signal & Risk Gate.\\n\\nDefault behavior is paper execution. Replace placeholder HTTP nodes with real Exchange API API calls only after demo testing and risk review."
